WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Recognize a guest purchase
Platform admins see the Guest purchase badge, invoice and delivery
contact. An absent email is expected. Payment belongs to the umbrella
invoice.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Let the store choose
Guest checkout starts enabled. The tenant can save a change here to
require sign-in for new purchases. Existing receipts remain accessible
until guest access expires.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Explain the same policy in Arabic
The Arabic control explains required phone, optional email, cash on
delivery and the account benefits that need sign-in.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Fulfill within the approved workspace
Vendors see their own order and guest badge. Buyer phone and email stay
hidden. Existing fulfillment, commission and settlement rules continue
to apply.

